    <mxCell id="note" value="SECURITY PROPERTIES: authorization enforced server-side on every call (route gates are UX only) &#183; times and lateness derive from server PH time &#183; GPS is self-reported, validated, audit-only, never gates the punch &#183; leftmost X-Forwarded-For entries are ignored (client-spoofable)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Montserrat;fontSize=9;fontColor=#393939;fillColor=#F5FAFA;align=left;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
